+ * adapters' (lisa on either module: WST, Cinemate, LS/VW host firmware last) and the
+ * Lifestyle 650's. The stick writes linuxPatched, ubi.img, MLO and u-boot.img from any of
+ * them and nothing else: BCO, CC2540, STM32, host, soundbar and console firmware stay for
+ * Bose's own software, which updates them itself.
